@startuml Device Token & Push Notification Flow

!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam handwritten false

actor User as U
participant "Mobile App" as MA
participant "Auth API" as AUTH
participant "Social API" as SOCIAL
participant "Device Token Service" as DTS
participant "Push Notification Service" as PNS
participant "Notification Settings" as NS
database "Database" as DB
participant "Firebase FCM" as FCM

== Device Token Registration ==

U -> MA: Login/Signup
MA -> AUTH: POST /auth/login\n{username, password, device_token, platform}
AUTH -> DTS: register_device_token(user_id, token, platform)
DTS -> DB: Store/Update DeviceToken
AUTH --> MA: Login Success
MA --> U: Logged In

== Social Interaction with Push Notification ==

U -> MA: Create Post
MA -> SOCIAL: POST /feed/post\n{content}
SOCIAL -> DB: Save Post
SOCIAL -> DB: Get Followers
SOCIAL -> PNS: send_to_multiple_users(follower_ids, "New Post", body, "posts")

loop For each follower
    PNS -> NS: Check notification preferences
    NS -> DB: Query NotificationSettings
    alt Notifications Enabled
        PNS -> DB: Get DeviceTokens for user
        PNS -> FCM: Send Push Notification
        FCM --> MA: Push Notification Received
        MA --> U: Show Notification
    else Notifications Disabled
        PNS -> PNS: Skip notification
    end
end

SOCIAL --> MA: Post Created
MA --> U: Success

== Notification Preferences Management ==

U -> MA: Open Settings
MA -> SOCIAL: GET /notifications/preferences
SOCIAL -> DB: Query NotificationSettings
SOCIAL --> MA: Current preferences
MA --> U: Show Settings

U -> MA: Update Preferences
MA -> SOCIAL: PUT /notifications/preferences\n{posts: false, likes: true, ...}
SOCIAL -> DB: Update NotificationSettings
SOCIAL --> MA: Updated
MA --> U: Settings Saved

== Event Creation Flow ==

U -> MA: Create Event
MA -> SOCIAL: POST /events/event_info
SOCIAL -> DB: Save Event
SOCIAL -> DB: Get Creator's Followers
SOCIAL -> PNS: send_to_multiple_users(follower_ids, "New Event", body, "events")
PNS -> NS: Check "events" preference for each user
alt Events Enabled
    PNS -> FCM: Send Notification
    FCM --> MA: Event Notification
end
SOCIAL --> MA: Event Created

== Like/Comment Flow ==

U -> MA: Like Post
MA -> SOCIAL: POST /feed/post/{id}/like
SOCIAL -> DB: Save Like
SOCIAL -> DB: Get Post Author
SOCIAL -> PNS: send_to_user(author_id, "New Like", body, "likes")
PNS -> NS: Check "likes" preference
alt Likes Enabled
    PNS -> FCM: Send Notification
    FCM --> MA: Like Notification
end

== Logout (Token Persistence) ==

U -> MA: Logout
MA -> AUTH: POST /auth/logout
note right: Device tokens are NOT removed
AUTH --> MA: Logged Out
MA --> U: Logged Out

note over DTS, FCM: Tokens remain active for re-engagement notifications

@enduml